        "text": "§\nAdverse Effects (5) : \"-platins\"\n\n(1) Ototoxicity\n(2) Peripheral neuropathy\n\n(3) Nephrotoxicity\n\n(4) Acute tubular necrosis\n\n(5) Myelosuppression\n\n(Oto-/Nephrotoxicity: Cisplatin > Carboplatin >>> Oxaliplatin)\n\n[Image: 2fed2141967c20e2fc29e237594561b222b789fe0a1a8f2f2479cac1091ec1c8]\n\n[Image: 1993197ede25f3c53e91da476867c85094ff3e479bc99507070766823a8e6b05]\n\n[Image: 91fbcac2dccca91a8c231c6f5bc390f4fe5239919569dabfc5e57e5c67038a4e]\n\n[Image: 075d32003896b456c7babe185a3e7a88063f50ed02a6284151b39a39f2f19875]\n\n[Image: e96fd92f86db35fb352c56be7265481e33853a669aac8436e1b0d4f214ccf279]\n\n2.2 - Cisplatin, carboplatin, oxaliplatin, amifostine\n[Image: 39e77f32bc3c3c1d24e22b8d2a483bb424ad4524cb4c652a7d939b14cddb6eb0]\n\n[Image: 0cac665e307a95318ba64875f612cbbef8931ab8c0c1ca7e7135dcfd0a5727d6]",
